ng value, and my remaining tiles (W3, W4, W4, B2, B4, B5, B6, B7) lack clear meld formation paths. By passing, I preserve the option to form W2-W3-W4 chow and keep waiting for useful tiles like B3 (for B2-B3-B4), B8 (for B6-B7-B8), or W5 (for W3-W4-W5).\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
