ng unshown tile, making it nearly impossible to incorporate into a useful meld. Discarding it preserves my W2 pung potential and my strong B4-B5-B6-B7 sequence in Dots, which offers multiple flexible paths to complete my hand with chows. This keeps maximum flexibility for drawing into winning patterns.\n\nAnswer: Play T6"}
