er-scoring patterns. The B4-B7 sequence with 4 copies each still available offers strong drawing potential. Chi W3 would commit to an exposed meld too early without clear path to a winning hand, and the remaining 7 tiles don't form a coherent winning structure.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
